---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, appStoreUrl } from '../lib/site';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Press', url: '/press/' }];
---
<Base
  title="Inkline press kit: boilerplate, facts and assets | Inkline"
  description="Press information for Inkline: boilerplate, dated factual claims, founder details and downloadable assets."
  path="/press/"
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <div slot="masthead">
  <p class="kicker">Press</p>
  <h1>Press kit</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Boilerplate</h2>
    <p>{SITE.boilerplate}</p>

    <h2>Facts, with dates</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Launched on the App Store in July 2026 as an iPhone and iPad app.</li>
      <li>A checked directory of 5,175 publications across 105 markets and 72 languages, feed-verified before every release; registry v3, updated 11 August 2026.</li>
      <li>Every title in the directory carries its owner's public position on generative AI (111 licensed, 49 blocking or litigating, the rest with nothing on record), compiled from public sources and dated 16 August 2026.</li>
      <li>Version 1.6 (August 2026) added coverage reports, the Atlas globe of the world's press, per-keyword coverage numbers, and the generative-AI position dataset.</li>
      <li>Free to use; Inkline Pro from £2.99 a month or £14.99 a year in the UK, each with a week free. No accounts, no server-side component.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Founder</h2>
    <p>{SITE.author.name}, {SITE.author.title} and Wikipedia editor. Contact for interviews: <a href="mailto:hello@inklinenews.com">hello@inklinenews.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Assets</h2>
    <p>The downloadable zip of the Inkdrop mark, app icon and native-resolution screenshots is placed here from the §11.1 brand handover. Until the handover lands, asset requests to <a href="mailto:hello@inklinenews.com">hello@inklinenews.com</a> are answered by hand. A 26-second <a href="/media/app-preview.mp4">screen recording of 1.6 on iPad</a> is available for embedding or broadcast.</p>

    <p class="small"><a href={appStoreUrl('web-press')}>Inkline on the App Store</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
